---
---
<div class="partners" id="partners">
    <h2>For Professionals</h2>
    <p class="intro-p">I serve as a specialized resource for estate attorneys, wealth advisors, and concierge physicians.</p>
    <p class="desc-p">I complement your practice by translating the clinical side of the equation, ensuring your clients are as well-informed medically as they are legally.</p>
    
    <div class="integrity-box">
        <p class="quote">"Clinical integrity is my priority. I do not pay or receive referral fees."</p>
        <span class="author">Kim — Patient Advocate, PA-C</span>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .partners h2 {
        font-size: 2.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .intro-p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--text-dark);
    }

    .desc-p {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .integrity-box {
        padding: 2rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--royal-blue);
        background: var(--white);
    }

    .quote {
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--royal-blue);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .author {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--navy);
    }

    /* Responsive scaling */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .partners h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .integrity-box {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }
    }
</style>